  "totalBlocks": 43,
  "translatedBlocks": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29f5cfabf104a840",
      "translationZh": "SyGra 2.0.0 推出了 Studio，这是一个交互式环境，让合成数据生成成为一项透明、可视化的创作过程。你无需再在 YAML 文件和终端之间来回切换，而是可以直接在画布上编排流程，在提交前预览数据集，借助行内变量提示调整提示词，并实时观看执行过程的流式更新——所有操作都在同一个面板中完成。底层仍是同一个平台，因此你通过可视化方式进行的所有操作都会生成相应的、兼容 SyGra 的图配置和任务执行器脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f1634cf0cd605764",
      "translationZh": "Studio 能让你做什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "03ebbb73a9ed7672",
      "translationZh": "通过引导式表单配置和验证模型（OpenAI、Azure OpenAI、Ollama、Vertex、Bedrock、vLLM、自定义端点）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "487a7d9c947ba4ed",
      "translationZh": "连接 Hugging Face、文件系统或 ServiceNow 数据源，并在执行前预览数据行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "68c4fb7068748d9d",
      "translationZh": "通过选择模型、编写提示词（支持自动建议变量）以及定义输出或结构化模式来配置节点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c93d9d96c451d93",
      "translationZh": "使用共享状态变量和由 Pydantic 驱动的映射来设计下游输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "411bb6c213a77061",
      "translationZh": "端到端执行流程，通过节点级进度即时查看生成结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a508e961580dd1c",
      "translationZh": "借助行内日志、断点、基于 Monaco 的代码编辑器以及自动保存的草稿进行调试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dadd746b93b85702",
      "translationZh": "通过存储在 .executions/ 中的执行历史，监控每次运行的 token 成本、延迟和护栏检查结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "975803b614278583",
      "translationZh": "让我们一步步了解这一操作过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e27e0c65e7aade2f",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：配置数据源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b753c6e7727291f",
      "translationZh": "打开 Studio，点击 Create Flow，Start/End 节点会自动出现。在添加其他内容之前：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fade257ff0a24826",
      "translationZh": "选择一个连接器（Hugging Face、磁盘或 ServiceNow）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b9159824a6d59592",
      "translationZh": "输入 repo_id、split 或文件路径等参数，然后点击 Preview 获取示例行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "efec045b668e9772",
      "translationZh": "列名会立即成为状态变量（例如 {prompt}、{genre}），让你清楚地知道在提示词和处理器中可以引用哪些内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "333ec02e6f46d0aa",
      "translationZh": "验证通过后，Studio 会保持配置同步，并将这些变量传递到整个流程中，无需手动连线或猜测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6748a2ac8543d1c3",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：以可视化方式构建流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4400c8b75595322",
      "translationZh": "从组件面板中拖出所需的模块。以故事生成流水线为例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1504481d3d984569",
      "translationZh": "放置一个名为“Story Generator”的 LLM 节点，选择一个已配置的模型（例如 gpt-4o-mini），编写提示词，并将结果存储到 story_body 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31ceeb4642443ee7",
      "translationZh": "添加第二个 LLM 节点，命名为“Story Summarizer”，在提示词中引用 {story_body}，并将结果输出到 story_summary。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d054535081525ac",
      "translationZh": "如果需要可复用的逻辑或分支行为，可以切换结构化输出开关、接入工具，或添加 Lambda/Subgraph 节点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a71509a7a766f25d",
      "translationZh": "Studio 的详情面板将所有内容集中呈现，让你始终掌握上下文——包括模型参数、提示词编辑器、工具配置、前置/后置处理代码，甚至还有用于并行生成的多 LLM 设置。在提示词中输入 {，即可立即显示所有可用的状态变量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "38ec00a8aea52db5",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：检查并运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7f27c9d194e0b45",
      "translationZh": "打开 Code Panel，检查 Studio 正在生成的确切 YAML/JSON 内容。这与写入 tasks/examples/ 的产物完全相同，因此你看到的内容就是将被提交的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3221b9a5c4eb467d",
      "translationZh": "准备好执行时：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "204b2d70e5233ef2",
      "translationZh": "点击 Run Workflow。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c6e1002846ed256",
      "translationZh": "选择记录数量、批次大小、重试行为等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71d826291a2d7240",
      "translationZh": "点击 Run，即可在 Execution 面板中实时查看持续更新的节点状态、token 用量、延迟和成本。详细日志提供可观测性，让调试变得轻而易举。所有执行记录都会写入 .executions/runs/*.json。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2593216fe919fa4e",
      "translationZh": "运行结束后，下载输出，与先前的执行进行比较，并获取延迟元数据和用量详情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ce9a597090e16009",
      "translationZh": "看看实际运行效果！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "26e5c32dba3183d4",
      "translationZh": "运行现有工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9d64bb16e295f5c",
      "translationZh": "运行 Glaive Code Assistant 工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6157fd135dcd82d",
      "translationZh": "SyGra Studio 还可以执行 tasks 中现有的工作流。例如，tasks/examples/glaive_code_assistant/ 工作流会摄取 glaiveai/glaive-code-assistant-v2 数据集，起草答案，对其进行评议，并循环执行，直到评议返回“NO MORE FEEDBACK.”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b31018b853da6dc3",
      "translationZh": "在 Studio 中，你会看到：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c27fb2ea7523ac11",
      "translationZh": "画布布局——两个 LLM 节点（generate_answer 和 critique_answer）通过一条条件边相连，该边要么将流程路由回去以继续修订，要么在评议认为满意时退出至 END。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5488680beedafd9",
      "translationZh": "可调输入——Run 模态窗口允许你切换数据集划分、调整批次大小、限制记录数量或微调温度参数，无需修改 YAML。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb5902fbed9db1ec",
      "translationZh": "可观测的执行过程——观察两个节点依次亮起，查看中间评议结果，并实时监控状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7451483cbab3ba9",
      "translationZh": "生成的输出——生成的合成数据可直接用于模型训练、评估流水线或标注工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "61e8d44ad423a4a0",
      "translationZh": "开始使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4d719752bdfd487e",
      "translationZh": "文档：https://servicenow.github.io/SyGra/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c112ddae9b8f2108",
      "translationZh": "Studio 文档：https://servicenow.github.io/SyGra/getting_started/create_task_ui/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "917cfdfe0cf0bf15",
      "translationZh": "配置示例：tasks/examples/glaive_code_assistant/graph_config.yaml",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8143ac467e94295",
      "translationZh": "SyGra Studio 将合成数据工作流转化为可视化、用户友好的体验。一次配置，信心十足地构建，在具备完整可观测性的情况下运行，无需离开画布即可生成数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
